 *  terms in days ('' when it has none: it uses the sheet's terms) and the cap with two decimals ('' when there is none) and the proof threshold with two decimals ('' when there is none), all as in force on the sheet's today; and every value
 *  recorded for each dated setting, by key, oldest from-date first; and the permission matrix, by action ('' when blank); and the grace days ('' when off); and the note threshold with two decimals ('' when there is none), in force on the sheet's today; and the entry date (yyyy-mm-dd; '' when off); and each grade's grace in days ('' when it has none) and each grade's own proof threshold with two decimals ('' when it has none: it uses the sheet's), in force on the sheet's today; and the pot with two decimals ('' when there is none; not dated); and the parent sheet id ('' when there is none; not dated); and the fiscal year start month, 1 to 12 (not dated); and the alert threshold with two decimals ('' when off; not dated); and the rounding mode, half-up or half-even ('' when none), in force on the sheet's today; and the review threshold with two decimals ('' when there is none), in force on the sheet's today; and the escalation gap in days ('' when off; not dated); and the review SLA in days ('' when none; not dated); and the proof kinds ('' when none; not dated); and the default grade ('' when blank, A; not dated); and each grade's own clerk limit with two decimals ('' when it has none: it uses the sheet's), in force on the sheet's today; and the mid and the high score thresholds ('' when none; not dated). */
public record SettingsResponse(String clerkLimit, String floor, String terms, String latePct,
        String policyDate, String periodNumberingFrom, Map<String, String> gradeTerms, String cap,
        Map<String, List<Dated>> dated, String proofThreshold, Map<String, String> perms, String graceDays, String noteThreshold,
